{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_wedge #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk_i,\n    input  rst_ni,\n    input  en_i,\n    input  serial_i,\n    output r_edge_o,\n    output f_edge_o,\n    output serial_o\n);\n\n    // Ensure at least 2 stages for safe CDC\n    localparam SYNC_STAGES = (STAGES < 2) ? 2 : STAGES;\n\n    // Synchronizer chain\n    reg [SYNC_STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni)\n            sync_reg <= {SYNC_STAGES{1'b0}};\n        else\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[SYNC_STAGES-2:0], serial_i};\n    end\n\n    // Synchronized output\n    assign serial_o = sync_reg[SYNC_STAGES-1];\n\n    // Edge detection\n    reg serial_d;\n    reg r_edge;\n    reg f_edge;\n\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            serial_d <= 1'b0;\n            r_edge   <= 1'b0;\n            f_edge   <= 1'b0;\n        end\n        else begin\n            serial_d <= serial_o;\n            r_edge   <= serial_o & ~serial_d;\n            f_edge   <= ~serial_o & serial_d;\n        end\n    end\n\n    // Gated outputs\n    assign r_edge_o = r_edge & en_i;\n    assign f_edge_o = f_edge & en_i;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
